{"id":"wb-7-451","name":"建章宫遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"建章宫","text":"建章宫，为西汉汉武帝在汉长安城外西南侧修建的一座离宫，是汉武帝和汉昭帝时期的皇宫，西汉末年被赤眉军焚毁。遗址现位于中华人民共和国陕西省西安市未央区三桥镇，现存多座宫殿台基和太液池遗址。2013年，建章宫遗址被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%A0%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":95327858,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95327858","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d964b1f6f2770c7c57745284.jpg","title":"Relics_of_Jianzhang_Palace.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Relics_of_Jianzhang_Palace.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/Relics_of_Jianzhang_Palace.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acstar","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉长安城建章宫遗址","width":320,"height":213}}